    ($seed$22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000005$seed$, $seed$Tax Manager$seed$, $seed$Ridgeline Advisory Group$seed$, $seed$Ridgeline Advisory Group is a 45-person CPA firm in Atlanta serving closely held businesses, real estate partnerships and their owners. We are adding a Tax Manager ahead of the 2027 filing season.

